{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-107768-r4518416","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Hearty Beef Vegetable Soup","sourcePageId":107768,"sourceRevision":"4518416","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:27:12Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Hearty%20Beef%20Vegetable%20Soup&oldid=4518416","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:05:20.515Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using basil","Category:Recipes using beef broth and stock","Category:Recipes using beef round","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using celery","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using pasta","Category:Recipes using spinach","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"116d0878a469f76a45c0b2a4ff4a32d3f1827b124f255b2e7e20c5762ee3f39d","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Soup recipes\n| Yield = 10 cups\n|difficulty=2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Soups|Soups]]\n\nThe original contributor of this recipe noted that the recipe originated from their mother, who used to make it for them.\n\n==Ingredients==\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]] round steak, cut into ¾-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] [[Cookbook:Cube|cubes]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n*2 cans (28 ounces) [[Cookbook:Broth|beef broth]]\n*4 cups [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]] [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] dried [[Cookbook:Basil|basil leaves]]\n*1 can (14.5 ounces) stewed [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]]\n*2 cups sliced [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]]\n*2 cups bow-tie [[Cookbook:Pasta|noodles]]\n*2 cups torn fresh [[Cookbook:Spinach|spinach leaves]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# In a 4-[[Cookbook:Quart|quart]] saucepan over medium-high heat, brown beef in margarine.  \n# Add onion; cook until tender.  \n# Stir in beef broth, water, celery, and basil; bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].  \n# Cover; reduce heat and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] 1 hour.  \n# Add tomatoes, carrots, noodles; bring to a boil.  \n# Reduce heat and simmer, uncovered, 25 minutes.  \n# Stir in spinach; cook 5 minutes more.  \n\n==Notes, tips and variations==\n* For a hearty stew, remove 1 cup broth from soup, and stir in 3 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]] until smooth. Return mixture to soup; cook and stir until thickened.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using beef round]]\n[[Category:Recipes using spinach]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Hearty Beef Vegetable Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 pound beef round steak, cut into ¾-inch cubes","sourceText":"1 pound beef round steak, cut into ¾-inch cubes","amountText":